(text "CH224A: VHV1 + VBUS8 directly fused VBUS; EP0 -> pad11.\nWCH section 7.1 contradicts sections 4/6/8 on VBUS rating: vendor confirmation is a POWER-UP BLOCKER.\nAUX3V3 operates at negotiation 5 V; NO output-rail operation from fallback. No mains/input = no LEDs." (at 20.32 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.02 1.02)) (justify left)) (uuid "b1b22fce-30aa-51f9-8545-c6c28e77ca57"))
(text "Direct VBUS feed replaces the old CH224K 1k supply dropper.\nI2C 0x22/0x23; status 0x09 bit3 = PD active; current 0x50 x50mA.\nPG alone is not proof. Verify WCH silicon/document discrepancy before power." (at 20.32 162.56 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)) (uuid "b1535d21-e0c1-57ab-b29b-342a03776cf4"))
